From ca12e5e9ffd7847f3cca2fa6395968d46666e4bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: desocketed <desocketed@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 13:39:26 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] NX2NAVI_POOL_LAZY_KINDS=1|2 (default 0): the texture pool's
 first sync writes stand-ins as array runs, 1 only into the kinds in use and a
 kind's when it first appears; NX2NAVI_POOL_SLOW_MS=<ms> (default 0) logs a
 slower pool sync (#173)

---
 runtime/cfg.c          |  6 ++--
 runtime/vk_exec_draw.c | 64 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 66 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

